      <div type="transcription" xml:id="transcription_aad_0167" xml:lang="">
        <div/>
        <pb facs="https://iiif.acdh.oeaw.ac.at/aad/aad_00507/" ed="1r" type="sheet"/>
        <lb/>Prifysgol Cymru
        <lb/>COLEG PRIFYSGOL DEWI SANT
        <lb/>LLANBEDR PONT STEFFAN
        <lb/>Ceredigion
        <lb/>
        <lb/>University of Wales
        <lb/>SAINT DAVID's UNIVERSITY COLLEGE
        <lb/>LAMPETER
        <lb/>Cardiganshire
        <lb/>
        <lb/>Tel : Lampeter 351/352/415 - Ext.:
        
        <lb/>
        <lb/>20th May I973 
        <lb/>Dear Mr. Auden,
        <lb/>I am writing to you as president of the student 'New
        <lb/>Literary Society'. I am at present compiling our programme
        <lb/>for I973-4 and would like it to reflect as many aspects of
        <lb/>modern poetry as possible. To this end I hope to arrange
        <lb/>poetry readings by a varied selection of poets. I would,
        <lb/>therefore, be grateful if you would be willing to give a poetry
        <lb/>reading to the society.
        <lb/>As you may know Saint David's University College is the
        <lb/>smallest, but one of the oldest, university colleges in Britain;
        <lb/>yet it is situated in a part of Wales that although remote, is 
        <lb/>one of the most beautiful parts. Because the college is a little
        <lb/>more isolated than most we have found that outside speakers
        <lb/>are always assured of a warm reception and an appreciative 
        <lb/>audience. Moreover, if you wish to read here the college would
        <lb/>be pleased to provide accomodation etc., so that if you wish to
        <lb/>stay in the area for a few days this would be possible. A
        <lb/>suitable date would be late November/early December I973, but
        <lb/>if this proves to be inconvenient I would be grateful if you
        <lb/>would suggest an alternative.
        <lb/>I hope that you will be able to accept our offer and
        <lb/>would be obliged if you could suggest a fee together with a
        <lb/>rough estimate of your travelling expenses.
        <lb/>I look forward to hearing from you.
        <lb/>Yours sincerely,
        <lb/>Richard Else
        <lb/>Richard Else.
        <pb facs="https://iiif.acdh.oeaw.ac.at/aad/aad_00508/" ed="1v" type="sheet"/>
      </div>
    </body>
